we always say, look at the math. If that young&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:36.900 --> 00:02:41.760
group got more involved, they could wield so much&nbsp;
power and influence. Well, we are seeing in 18 to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:47.880
